        "world:creature:28859",
        "world:quest:24584"
      ],
      "text": "You are in the Eye of Eternity, the realm of Malygos, reached through the Nexus in Borean Tundra. Malygos, the Spell-Weaver, holds it, and he is draining magic out of the world to gather it here. He regards mortal intruders as ignorant children who dare to wield magic in his domain, and he boasts that his power is infinite.",
